以下是符合你需求的 SQL Query：
找出 Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer 與 EDD_ReviewSchedule 的 ReviewDt 不同的客戶，並同時顯示兩個日期。
WITH Mapping AS (
    SELECT 
        m.NEW_CIF_KEY,
        b.CustomerNo AS TS_CUST_ID,
        b.CIF_KEY AS BSA_CIF_KEY
    FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP m
    INNER JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b 
        ON m.NEW_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
),
Review_Compare AS (
    SELECT 
        m.TS_CUST_ID,
        m.NEW_CIF_KEY,
        m.BSA_CIF_KEY,
        b.ReviewDt AS Buffer_ReviewDt,           -- Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer
        e.ReviewDt AS EDD_ReviewDt,              -- EDD_ReviewSchedule
        CASE 
            WHEN b.ReviewDt IS NULL AND e.ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 0
            WHEN b.ReviewDt IS NULL OR e.ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 1
            WHEN b.ReviewDt <> e.ReviewDt THEN 1 
            ELSE 0 
        END AS ReviewDt_Diff_Flag
    FROM Mapping m
    LEFT JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer b 
        ON m.BSA_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
    LEFT JOIN EDD_ReviewSchedule e 
        ON m.NEW_CIF_KEY = e.CIFKey
    WHERE b.ReviewDt IS NOT NULL OR e.ReviewDt IS NOT NULL  -- 至少有一邊有日期
)
SELECT 
    TS_CUST_ID,
    NEW_CIF_KEY,
    BSA_CIF_KEY,
    Buffer_ReviewDt,
    EDD_ReviewDt,
    CASE 
        WHEN Buffer_ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 'Buffer 無日期'
        WHEN EDD_ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 'EDD 無日期'
        ELSE '日期不同'
    END AS Diff_Reason
FROM Review_Compare
WHERE ReviewDt_Diff_Flag = 1
ORDER BY TS_CUST_ID;

說明：
	1	Mapping CTE：先把 CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP 跟 BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT 對應起來，取得 TS_CUST_ID（CustomerNo）和兩個 CIF_KEY。
	2	Review_Compare CTE：同時 LEFT JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer 和 EDD_ReviewSchedule，取出兩個 ReviewDt 做比對。
	3	最終輸出：只顯示 ReviewDt 不同的客戶，並清楚標示差異原因。

如果你只要簡單版（不需要 Mapping 過程）：
SELECT 
    b.CustomerNo AS TS_CUST_ID,
    m.NEW_CIF_KEY,
    buf.ReviewDt AS Buffer_ReviewDt,
    edd.ReviewDt AS EDD_ReviewDt
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b
INNER JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP m 
    ON m.NEW_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
LEFT JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer buf 
    ON b.CIF_KEY = buf.CIF_KEY
LEFT JOIN EDD_ReviewSchedule edd 
    ON m.NEW_CIF_KEY = edd.CIFKey
WHERE (buf.ReviewDt <> edd.ReviewDt 
       OR buf.ReviewDt IS NULL AND edd.ReviewDt IS NOT NULL
       OR buf.ReviewDt IS NOT NULL AND edd.ReviewDt IS NULL)
ORDER BY b.CustomerNo;

